# Build context of the webdesk-api image is ./webdesk (see api/Dockerfile). Admit ONLY what the
# image builds from: api/, blocks/, delivery/. Everything else under webdesk/ (migrations, ops,
# deploy, sites, wordpress, qa, ...) stays out of the context.
*
!api/
!blocks/
!delivery/

# ...and inside the admitted trees, never installed dependencies, build output, test output or archives.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vitest
**/*.tgz
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
